        <mxCell id="dlB1TXSmg05-ScG6FHXB-3" parent="1" style="shape=process;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;backgroundOutline=1;strokeColor=#0F8B8D;fontColor=#143642;fillColor=#FAE5C7;size=0.02127659574468085;rounded=0;" value="&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;in the following cobol copybooks the type ist a 3 digit field called SAWX-:S-ART.&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(20, 54, 66), rgb(173, 202, 213));&quot;&gt;association is&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(20, 54, 66), rgb(173, 202, 213));&quot;&gt;S37DN61K for type 010,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(20, 54, 66), rgb(173, 202, 213));&quot;&gt;S37DN65K for type 015,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(20, 54, 66), rgb(173, 202, 213));&quot;&gt;S37DN62K for type 020,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(20, 54, 66), rgb(173, 202, 213));&quot;&gt;S37DN63K for type 030.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;p&gt;can you help me interpret the data in file bastel.txt&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(20, 54, 66), rgb(173, 202, 213));&quot;&gt;and ignore german umlaute&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;" vertex="1">
