        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="5FUGML_ANkqW0i52DTNW-2" parent="1" style="shape=ext;double=1;rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;labelBackgroundColor=none;fillColor=#FAE5C7;strokeColor=#0F8B8D;fontColor=#143642;" value="&lt;div&gt;Cobol CPB&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;für AvO Ziel-Satzarten&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;10, 20, 30 usw.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(#000000, var(--ge-light-color, #ffffff));&quot;&gt;Copybooks&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(#000000, var(--ge-light-color, #ffffff));&quot;&gt;S37F???K&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="110" width="150" x="190" y="350" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="cl66SgcKrTbLf-kFVP-Y-1" edge="1" parent="1" source="5FUGML_ANkqW0i52DTNW-3" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;exitX=0;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;exitPerimeter=0;entryX=0.001;entryY=0.23;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;" target="qmSQnf_pR1lWU4W59Fsz-1">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" x="-0.8872" as="geometry">
            <mxPoint x="440" y="320" as="targetPoint" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="5FUGML_ANkqW0i52DTNW-3" parent="1" style="strokeWidth=2;html=1;shape=mxgraph.flowchart.annotation_2;align=left;labelPosition=right;pointerEvents=1;strokeColor=#0F8B8D;fontColor=#143642;fillColor=#FAE5C7;rotation=-180;rounded=0;" value="" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="430" width="50" x="380" y="200" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="5FUGML_ANkqW0i52DTNW-5" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;fontColor=#143642;" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;Versuch 2: Vorschlag: Anreichern Informationen aus Dokument-XML&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="30" width="660" x="200" y="160" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="qmSQnf_pR1lWU4W59Fsz-1" parent="1" style="shape=process;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;backgroundOutline=1;strokeColor=#0F8B8D;fontColor=#143642;fillColor=#FAE5C7;size=0.02127659574468085;rounded=0;align=left;" value="&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;In the following cobol copybooks the type ist a 3 digit field called SAWX-:S-ART. association is S37DN61K for type 010, S37DN65K for type 015, S37DN62K for type 020, S37DN63K for type 030.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(20, 54, 66), rgb(173, 202, 213));&quot;&gt;Additional, In the following cobol copybooks the type is a 4 digit field called :SAWX-:SATZART. In the file AvO-Echt.txt the field starts at position 29: S37F010K - F010, S37F020K - F020, S37F030K - F030 and so on.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(20, 54, 66), rgb(173, 202, 213));&quot;&gt;In addition, take a look at the COBOL program P06__NDOX__ and add copybooks as needed.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(20, 54, 66), rgb(173, 202, 213));&quot;&gt;It generates the file police.xml based on a large amount of data from Bastel.txt.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(20, 54, 66), rgb(173, 202, 213));&quot;&gt;Police.xml can help you enrich the data generated during the evaluation of the copybooks mentioned above.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(20, 54, 66), rgb(173, 202, 213));&quot;&gt;For the following questions, start by writing a continuous text, summarise the results appropriately in tables, and thirdly, create a diagram showing the data you have found:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(20, 54, 66), rgb(173, 202, 213));&quot;&gt;What relationship do you indentify&amp;nbsp; between the data in the copies S37DN6?K and S37F???K&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(20, 54, 66), rgb(173, 202, 213));&quot;&gt;What data do you find in `police.xml` that could be used to interpret and describe the relationship?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Which data still cannot be interpreted?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;What data do you find in `Bastel.txt` that does not appear in `police.xml`?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="350" width="600" x="460" y="240" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
